## 2. Red-contract edits this run

Three targeted edits inside
`measure/tests/test_apk_source_denominator_inventory_phase4.py`, scoped
strictly to the Phase 4 test file (no production source, no validator
authoring, no denominator/candidate/owner/accepted artifacts, no plan
task claim, no plan task completion marker):

